{title: Kaash Phir Se}
{artist: Mohit Chauhan Jeet Ganguly}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
Kash fir [A] se [D] beete,        [F#m] lamhe chura ke woh Main [A] jiyun [D]
Kash fir [F#m] se [E] paas,        [A] tuzko bitha ke mai Dekh [F#m] loon [E]
Hain aayi teri [D] yaadein,        Tu fir [F#m] dhadka de
Nahi [E] dhadka kayi dino se dil [Dsus4] mera [A]
Lafzon bin [D] baatein haan kaise [F#m] samjhate
Meri [E] khamoshi faaslon ki hai [Dsus4] wajah [A],        Kash fir [A] se [D] ..
[A] Chaahe mera dil yeh,        Tu [F#m] chahe fir [Bm] mujhe
[D] Meri zindagi mein,        Main [E] rakh loon fir [A] tujhe
[A] Tere [C#m] kadmon se,        Yeh raahein [F#m] fir [Bm] judein
[D] Teri hi hawa mein,        Yeh [E] saansein fir [A] udein
Hain aankhon ki [D] duayein,        Woh phir laut [F#m] aayein
Jo [E] palko se tha rutha khwaab [Dsus4] sa [A],        Kash fir [A] se [D] dhup [F#m] chhaon tere [E] sang
Baant [A] loon [D],        Kash fir [F#m] se...
